WEBVTT

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:11.600
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:29.420
"Intersecting Hearts and Bodies"

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:30.000
Which Nanman king fought against the Shu armies with Meng Huo...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.490
...and ruled over Wuguo?

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:35.120
Uh, King Wutugu?

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:36.180
Ding ding ding!

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:39.660
Okay. One day while lost...

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:44.240
...you encounter a man who only tells lies and a man who only tells the truth.

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:45.120
Now...

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:50.860
Hey, wait. There's no way that question...

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:52.360
...would appear on the midterm.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:53.520
You got me.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.010
Do you have a cold?

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.720
Maybe.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.430
I do feel a little weak.

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.010
What?

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:15.240
Shuri!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.630
B-but why?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.230
She isn't dead, right?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.420
Sh-Shuri...

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.030
Tomo.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.650
What if they call the cops?

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:37.300
Let's get her inside.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:39.660
Oof.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:42.180
Why is she so heavy?

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.000
What?

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:49.590
Is this...?

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:57.100
Which way now?

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.800
Go straight.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:00.890
Right a little bit.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.190
A little more.

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:03.220
Too far, too far.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:04.510
Right there.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:07.720
Right. Now reach out your hands...

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.670
...and push from both sides...

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.370
Is there more?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.010
Of course.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:20.020
If you leave here in these wet clothes...

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.060
...she'll catch a cold.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:25.000
What now?

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.150
While holding the right edge...

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:28.960
...lift her shoulder and...

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:32.000
Hey! What are you touching?

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.880
It wasn't on purpose.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.890
I don't really know where everything is.

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:38.520
Hmph.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.760
There had to be a better way to do this.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.530
We couldn't help it.

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:46.890
I can't touch her...

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.320
...and you're incompetent.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:49.960
Who are you calling incompetent?

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.500
Towel next.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:52.800
I know.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.170
So soft.

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:58.020
Tomo.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.520
That's a pillow.

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:04.100
You have to guide me.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.910
What are you getting mad at me for?

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.540
Well, I can't see.

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.760
You need to go a lot lower.

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:15.020
Hey!

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.730
Why are you groping her like that?

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.340
And with both hands, too!

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:21.920
N-n-no! It wasn't on purpose! Really!

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:23.600
Just forget it.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.000
Don't worry about drying her.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.730
There's just one thing left.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:30.660
What's wrong, Tomo?

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:33.290
I think I'm getting a nosebleed.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.370
What? Why does it have to be now?

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:37.320
B-because...

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:41.930
W-what do we do? She's waking up!

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.590
Why don't you just leave the room?

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:45.930
Right.

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.770
Misao, the rest is up to you.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.550
Wait, Tomo!

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.250
Don't take off your blindfold!

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.130
Um...

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:02.350
W-wait.

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:05.150
Just hear me out, Shuri.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:06.480
I was just...

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:14.130
W-w-wait, Shuri.

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:17.000
I have a cold, so...

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.360
Right, right. This is just snot...

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:26.290
Are you alright?

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:28.370
Your nosebleed...

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.020
Shuri?

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:36.260
Shuri!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.910
Shuri! You've got a fever.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.030
I'm fine.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:44.250
You're not fine at all.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:45.850
Use me for support.

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:50.460
Thank you.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:51.860
Um...

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.810
...what is your name?

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.920
Why are you being so kind to me?

00:06:58.210 --> 00:06:59.650
What are you talking about?

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:02.750
Do you really have to joke around at a time like this?

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.680
Who is Shuri?

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:12.660
My name is Yukari.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.630
I'm Asanami Middle School's second year Kurosaki...

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:17.680
Yukari Kurosa...

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:22.760
Yukari Kurosaki?

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.760
What's going on?

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.010
Who knows?

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.350
Huh?

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.940
Good morning, Tomoharu.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.330
Good... morning...

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:07.320
Are you alright?

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:09.480
Shu... Yukari?

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:12.380
Yes. Sorry for all the trouble.

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:20.370
Feel free to stay here.

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:23.950
Make yourself at home.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:27.090
Try not to use too much force...

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:29.790
Of course.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.350
I'll see you later.

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:35.870
Tomoharu, your necktie is crooked.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.760
Come on. We'll be late.

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.050
Okay. See you later.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:45.810
See you later.

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.680
I guess she must be someone else.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.200
Yukari Kurosaki...

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.020
"Class 1-7"

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:03.020
Tomo, do you really have a cold?

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:05.270
I'm fine.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.660
What are you muttering about?

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:10.290
Tomo. You look dead.

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:11.520
Are you okay?

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:13.670
I'm a little under the weather...

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:14.800
Tomo.

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.350
There's something I wanted to ask you.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.350
About Shuri...

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:21.630
The acting president?

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:22.480
Yeah.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:26.000
Do you know anything about her family?

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:30.230
If she has a sister at our school, or something?

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:31.800
Or a twin?

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:33.030
A twin?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:35.030
Who's been saying that?

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.840
No one.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.420
She stands out.

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:41.090
If there were another face like her's here...

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:42.730
...we would have heard about it by now.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:44.470
I guess.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:48.670
In that case, have you heard of a Yukari Kurosaki?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.090
Yukari Kurosaki?

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.470
I feel like I've heard that name before.

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:56.080
Maybe I'm just making things up.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:57.990
Well, at the very least...

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.620
...we know she isn't a student here.

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:03.660
Tomoharu Natsume.

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:08.880
Mr. President.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.560
Can I help you?

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:14.010
We're better off not listening to him, Tomo.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:16.220
It can't be anything good.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.950
Kurosaki hasn't been at school this week.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:23.770
What? Has Shuri been absent that much?

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:27.250
And the Second Student Council is moving.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:31.320
Kurosaki doesn't have anything to do with that, does she?

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:32.170
Huh?

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:32.890
What?

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:35.890
I don't think she's involved.

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.750
Is the Second Student Council...

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:42.620
...something Mahiwa and Rikka are involved in?

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:43.680
Yes.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:46.070
Has there been another unfortunate incident?

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:48.390
I suppose you could call it unfortunate.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:50.880
As a neutral power...

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:53.000
...they certainly aren't evil.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:56.480
However, they're hardly what you'd call good.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:02.010
I can't imagine them waging war against the Science Club or the Dark Society...

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:05.430
...but at the moment, their motives are unclear.

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:07.610
If I were you, I'd watch my step.

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:10.350
Understood.

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.310
What was that about?

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.280
What's his problem?

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:28.780
Don't give me your cold, Tomo.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:31.380
It's getting worse, don't you think?

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:34.450
Um...

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:36.410
"Non-sugar Mint Cough Drops"

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:36.410
"Mask"

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.430
Here.

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:39.060
Thanks.

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.440
Takatsuki, do you always carry this stuff with you?

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.460
I am the class nurse.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.850
She sure is weird.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:53.440
A church?

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.320
Does Shuri really live here?

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:00.570
District 5, block 8.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.000
We're here all right.

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:05.460
Hey, wait.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:12.590
Let's go in.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.030
Hey.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.960
Have some respect. This isn't our house.

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.330
Hello?

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:24.200
Anybody home?

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.740
We're coming in.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:34.280
Shuri?

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.440
Huh. I didn't expect these.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:41.960
You panty thief!

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:43.730
That's not what I'm doing.

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:45.440
I'm getting clothes for Shuri.

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:49.370
I can't have her running around in just a shirt.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.100
You're the only one that has a problem with it.

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:55.690
I see those dirty looks.

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:56.740
Shut up.

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:02.890
This...

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:07.190
So that must have been...

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.240
Look, Tomo.

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:13.700
"Flight 901 Crashes"

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:13.700
"More than 100 dead"

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.790
Why does she have these articles?

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:15.800
What?

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.950
It's coming from the church.

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:37.000
Tomo.

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:42.430
Hello.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.050
Do you have business with the church?

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:00.730
I was hoping to meet with the priest.

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:03.230
Are you a member of this church?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:04.460
No.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.980
There is no one here any more.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.940
I heard the priest passed away recently.

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:16.030
His daughter seems to be maintaining the grounds.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:17.530
His daughter?

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:19.100
He must be talking about Shuri.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.070
She's probably adopted.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:25.590
She just appeared here about three years ago.

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:27.850
Three years ago?

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:37.710
So you're not a member of this church?

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:40.750
I just came here for confession.

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.790
Confession? I hope I didn't disturb you.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.560
Don't worry about it.

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:50.110
Well, in that case, we'll be going...

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:51.780
"We?"

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.640
You're a Rakurowa High School student, aren't you?

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:56.660
What's your name?

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:59.190
It's Natsume.

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:00.660
Tomoharu Natsume.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.810
I'm Yo Susugihara.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.290
But don't worry about remembering my name.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:10.660
Good bye, Mr. Natsume.

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:18.010
What's up with her?

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:19.230
Huh? Her?

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:21.560
Yeah. Didn't you notice?

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:23.130
No.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:26.270
I see.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:55.700
My... burial doll...

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:05.740
I'm home.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:08.540
Welcome home, Tomoharu.

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:11.270
Yukari, I just...

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:12.840
Are you hungry?

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:14.520
Huh? I guess...

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:17.210
Oh, good. I baked a cake.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:18.850
Would you like some?

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:20.290
Yes, please.

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:22.000
Oh, wait, I mean...

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:24.830
...I just stopped by your house.

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:26.830
Well, I guess it was a church.

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:28.070
I went there.

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:31.660
Y-Yukari.

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:34.490
I brought you a change of clothes. Here.

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:35.930
Please put this on.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:41.360
Is that what you prefer, Tomoharu?

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:44.670
That's not what I meant.

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.170
Wear these.

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:48.900
You prefer the blue ones?

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:51.190
Uh...

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:52.210
I know.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:55.560
Were you able to remember anything?

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:57.980
No, I just...

00:16:58.390 --> 00:16:58.910
Just...?

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.890
I had a strange dream.

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:02.390
A strange dream?

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.800
I've found you, Shuri Kurosaki.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:09.340
"Amazing Gold Dragon"

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.220
What is this?

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:18.400
There are so many.

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:22.430
I found this room while cleaning this afternoon.

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:26.390
Just what is my brother involved in...

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:32.470
What are all these trunks?

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:34.210
They were in my dream.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:37.700
You mean that strange dream you were talking about?

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:39.640
I also...

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:42.850
...don't really know.

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:45.750
Then, do you know what a burial doll is?

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.460
Burial doll?

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:49.610
I've never heard of it.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.010
I don't know.

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:53.920
Misao, are you okay?

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.370
I'm fine.

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.630
Aren't you the one that's not feeling well?

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:00.340
I found it.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.090
What?

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:03.650
I found it.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.630
I found the stabilizer.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:09.590
The stabilizer is mine.

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:19.290
Tomo!

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:28.060
I won't let you hurt Tomoharu.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.830
Takatsuki? Why?

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.460
I got a strange feeling...

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:35.780
Kanade Takatsuki.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.180
This doesn't look good.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:44.830
Mahiwa!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.180
Long time no see, Tomoharu.

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:49.330
We just saw each other.

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:50.320
Is that so?

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.480
Does that doll belong to you?

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:54.150
It's not a doll.

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.030
Its name is Widget.

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:57.150
What are you doing?

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:59.000
My job.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:01.110
They told me to get the stabilizer.

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:02.510
Stabilizer?

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.940
The doll mentioned that, too.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:08.050
I don't have time to get into the details.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:11.150
I've got a lot of work to do.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:14.470
It's helping me save a fortune feeding Vivian.

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:22.760
Vivian, get the stabilizer!

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:25.430
Don't worry.

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:27.990
Kurosaki's suffering from amnesia.

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:29.080
She won't be able to fight back.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.880
T-Tomoharu!

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:35.940
Yukari!

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:38.880
Misao!

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:39.490
Okay!

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:42.230
Come, Kurogane!

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.850
Don't do it, Tomoharu!

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:52.610
Oh, no.

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:01.450
I can't do it, Tomo!

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:02.470
Misao!

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:32.520
Yukari!

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:35.120
Are you okay?

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:38.430
Where is the stabilizer?

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.810
I'm sorry. They've taken it.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.710
The Asura Machina...

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:45.810
She's...

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:47.410
She's...

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:52.430
Who?

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:06.530
I have it.

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:10.940
Good work.

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:12.880
That was a tough job.

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:16.330
By the way, what is a stabilizer, anyway?

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:19.370
Its the sweet key to a secret garden.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:39.240
Mr. Client! Are you dead?

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.800
Nice work, Shuri.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:25.230
"Preview"

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:21.750
I have one wish.

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:23.660
In order to break free...

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:25.200
I won't give it up.

00:23:25.200 --> 00:23:26.020
Wait.

00:23:26.290 --> 00:23:27.830
Those eyes reflect...

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:29.320
...guilt and illusion.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:31.030
It isn't me.

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:35.020
"Sacrifice beyond the Darkness"
